  "budgetClockRule": "max_work_units is the runtime-enforced hard bound. advisory_max_micros is a host scheduling hint recorded in receipts; the host measures elapsed wall time around each call and enforces product frame/span gates. Runtime correctness never depends on observing a wall clock."
